    as :math:`log(a*b) = log(a)+log(b)`.

    >>> x1 = jnp.array([2, 1, 3, 1])
    >>> x2 = jnp.array([1, 3, 2, 4])
    >>> jnp.allclose(jnp.log(x1*x2), jnp.log(x1)+jnp.log(x2))
    Array(True, dtype=bool)

